Architecture v1

Here is the exact architecture draft I should use.
Public vs private

Public
    Only these should be public:
    ALB
    public subnets
    Internet Gateway

Private
    Everything else stays private:
        EKS worker nodes
        app pods
        RDS
        Redis
        SQS access from workloads
        S3 access from workloads
        monitoring stack
        internal service-to-service traffic

This is important. If you expose more than you need, you look careless minimum in public subnet or exposed always follow least priviledges.


Traffic flow
    North-south traffic 
        User → ALB → Ingress → API service

    East-west traffic
        API service → PostgreSQL
        API service → SQS
        API service → Redis

        Worker service → SQS
        Worker service → PostgreSQL
        Worker service → S3
        Worker service → Redis

    Notification service → PostgreSQL or internal event path depending on your later design

    Prometheus scrapes app and cluster metrics
    Loki collects logs from cluster workloads


Availability Zone behavior

Design across 2 AZs.
Spread across both AZs
    public subnets
    private app subnets
    private DB subnets
    EKS nodes
    ALB targets
    RDS Multi-AZ
What happens if one AZ fails ??
    ALB still serves through remaining AZ
    EKS reschedules pods to healthy nodes in remaining AZ if capacity exists
    API remains reachable if replicas span zones
    worker continues if replicas span zones
    RDS Multi-AZ fails over to standby
    SQS remains service-managed and available
    Redis behavior depends on setup; for now treat it as available managed service but still document it as a potential degradation point
    monitoring may partially degrade if sized too tightly
What can still hurt you in one-AZ failure
    insufficient node capacity in surviving AZ
    temporary DB failover interruption
    pods without proper replica count
    single NAT Gateway design if you cut corners
    cost-saving shortcuts that reduce HA

That is the kind of thinking that makes you sound serious.


